'''Itsy Bitsy Spider''' is a [[Curiosity]] which can be used in the [[Study Report]] to earn [[Learning Points]].

The quality is the same quality as the item it was picked up with.

==How to Acquire==

It can occasionally be found while foraging any kind of object.

